    "title": "Kaya's School Trip Adventures",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya packed her suitcase for the school trip.",
      "The airplane ride was quite long.",
      "It was cloudy but warm, not windy.",
      "They went hiking and saw a monkey once.",
      "A fox was running past, making Kaya feel scared.",
      "The fourth stop was for arts and crafts or calligraphy.",
      "They ate chicken sandwiches with a slice. \"No soy sauce seasoning!\"",
      "Because of rain, swimming, skating, and skiing were cancelled.",
      "They played dodge ball twice and talked about rugby.",
      "Kaya went to the restroom, then heard singing for a concert.",
      "The teacher gave a moral education lesson. \"Why can't I answer?\"",
      "She saw a million stars, including Cancer, feeling such happiness."
    ]
  }
